{"seq":2,"slug":"serverless-security","title":"Serverless 安全实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/serverless-security","wordCount":1634,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"serverless-安全实践\">Serverless 安全实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Serverless 安全既继承了传统应用安全的核心原则（最小权限、纵深防御、安全默认），也引入了独特的安全挑战。函数的短暂生命周期、高度依赖第三方服务、事件驱动的输入多样性、以及传统安全工具（WAF、IDS）的适应困难，共同构成了 Serverless 安全的复杂性。</p>\n<p>Serverless 安全的责任模型（Shared Responsibility Model）与传统架构有本质区别。云提供商负责运行时环境安全（OS 补丁、网络隔离、执行环境）；用户负责应用代码安全（函数逻辑、依赖管理、IAM 权限、数据加密）。这看似减轻了用户的安全负担，实际上提升了应用层安全的重要性——因为底层已经安全，攻击面聚焦在应用层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 云提供商责任&#10;        A[物理基础设施]&#10;        B[网络基础设施]&#10;        C[执行环境隔离]&#10;        D[运行时补丁]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 用户责任&#10;        E[函数代码安全]&#10;        F[IAM权限配置]&#10;        G[依赖管理]&#10;        H[数据加密]&#10;        I[输入验证]&#10;        J[密钥管理]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 云提供商责任\n        A[物理基础设施]\n        B[网络基础设施]\n        C[执行环境隔离]\n        D[运行时补丁]\n    end\n    subgraph 用户责任\n        E[函数代码安全]\n        F[IAM权限配置]\n        G[依赖管理]\n        H[数据加密]\n        I[输入验证]\n        J[密钥管理]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全维度</th>\n<th>传统架构</th>\n<th>Serverless</th>\n<th>风险变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OS 补丁</td>\n<td>用户负责</td>\n<td>云平台负责</td>\n<td>降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时更新</td>\n<td>用户负责</td>\n<td>云平台负责</td>\n<td>降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DDoS 防护</td>\n<td>WAF + 限流</td>\n<td>API Gateway 限流 + WAF</td>\n<td>相当</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限管理</td>\n<td>粗粒度（服务器级）</td>\n<td>细粒度（函数级 IAM）</td>\n<td>复杂度提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖安全</td>\n<td>需扫描</td>\n<td>同样需扫描（攻击面更大）</td>\n<td>提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据注入</td>\n<td>HTTP 输入</td>\n<td>HTTP + 事件 + 消息</td>\n<td>攻击面扩大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密钥管理</td>\n<td>配置文件/HSM</td>\n<td>环境变量/Secrets Manager</td>\n<td>需要新实践</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"iam-最小权限实践\">IAM 最小权限实践</h2><p>IAM（Identity and Access Management）是 Serverless 安全的基石。每个 Lambda 函数都有一个执行角色（Execution Role），定义函数可以访问的 AWS 服务和资源。遵循最小权限原则（Principle of Least Privilege），每个函数只授予完成其任务所需的最小权限集。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式</strong>：许多 Serverless 项目为了方便，给所有函数共享同一个具有广泛权限的角色（如 <code>AmazonDynamoDBFullAccess</code>、<code>AmazonS3FullAccess</code>）。这严重违反最小权限原则——一个只需要读取特定 DynamoDB 表的函数不应该有权删除任何表。</p>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：每个函数一个角色，权限精确到资源 ARN 和操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;Version&quot;: &quot;2012-10-17&quot;,&#10;  &quot;Statement&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,&#10;      &quot;Action&quot;: [&quot;dynamodb:GetItem&quot;, &quot;dynamodb:Query&quot;],&#10;      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:123456789:table/Users&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,&#10;      &quot;Action&quot;: [&quot;dynamodb:GetItem&quot;, &quot;dynamodb:Query&quot;],&#10;      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:123456789:table/Users/index/*&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,&#10;      &quot;Action&quot;: [&quot;sqs:SendMessage&quot;],&#10;      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:sqs:us-east-1:123456789:user-notifications&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"Version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2012-10-17\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"Statement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Allow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dynamodb:GetItem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dynamodb:Query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Resource\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:123456789:table/Users\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Allow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dynamodb:GetItem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dynamodb:Query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Resource\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:123456789:table/Users/index/*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Allow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sqs:SendMessage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Resource\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arn:aws:sqs:us-east-1:123456789:user-notifications\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>IAM Access Analyzer</strong> 可以自动分析 CloudTrail 日志，生成基于实际使用的最小权限策略。在开发阶段给予较宽松的权限，上线前使用 Access Analyzer 收敛到实际使用的最小集合。</p>\n<p><strong>权限边界（Permission Boundary）</strong>：为整个 Serverless 应用设置权限边界，限制函数角色能够获得的最大权限范围。即使开发者错误配置了过宽的权限，边界也能阻止越权访问。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>IAM 策略</th>\n<th>颗粒度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资源级策略</td>\n<td>精确到特定 ARN</td>\n<td>生产环境（必须）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件键约束</td>\n<td>按标签/VPC/时间</td>\n<td>多租户/合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限边界</td>\n<td>限制最大权限范围</td>\n<td>团队级安全约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SCP (Service Control Policy)</td>\n<td>组织级限制</td>\n<td>多账户架构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"输入验证与注入防护\">输入验证与注入防护</h2><p>Serverless 函数的输入来源比传统 API 更多样：HTTP 请求、SQS 消息、S3 事件、DynamoDB Streams、Kinesis 记录、EventBridge 事件等。每种输入都可能携带恶意数据，必须进行严格的验证和清洗。</p>\n<p><strong>OWASP Serverless Top 10</strong> 中排名最高的风险就是注入攻击（Injection）。攻击者通过恶意事件数据注入 SQL、NoSQL、OS 命令或表达式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;&#10;const orderEventSchema = z.object({&#10;  orderId: z.string().uuid(),&#10;  userId: z.string().regex(/^USR-[0-9]+$/),&#10;  amount: z.number().positive().max(1000000),&#10;  currency: z.enum([&#39;USD&#39;, &#39;EUR&#39;, &#39;GBP&#39;, &#39;CNY&#39;]),&#10;  items: z&#10;    .array(&#10;      z.object({&#10;        sku: z.string().regex(/^[A-Z]{3}-[0-9]{6}$/),&#10;        quantity: z.number().int().positive().max(999),&#10;      }),&#10;    )&#10;    .min(1)&#10;    .max(100),&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const handler = async (event: SQSEvent) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const record of event.Records) {&#10;    const parsed = orderEventSchema.safeParse(JSON.parse(record.body));&#10;    if (!parsed.success) {&#10;      console.error(&#39;Invalid event&#39;, parsed.error.flatten());&#10;      continue;&#10;    }&#10;    await processOrder(parsed.data);&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> orderEventSchema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  orderId: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uuid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  userId: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">USR-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[0-9]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">positive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EUR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GBP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  items: z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sku: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark